{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09234","headline":"奉和圣制重阳日赐宴 · 韦应物","name":"奉和圣制重阳日赐宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣心忧万国，端居在穆清。\n玄功致海[晏]，锡讌表文明。\n恩属重阳节，雨应此时晴。\n寒菊生池苑，高树出宫城。\n捧藻千官处，垂戒百王程。\n复覩开元日，臣愚献颂声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09234.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09234","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}